description:
A game where the object is to discard your entire hand of cards.  Three dice are rolled on a players turn and the outcome of the dice determines what the player can discard (or pick-up) that turn.

From the box:

&quot;Be the first to discard all of your cards and win the round, but watch out! A &quot;Deer in the Headlights&quot; roll will stall your progress. Roll a &quot;Car&quot; or &quot;Running Deer&quot; and dump cards on your opponents.&quot;
